1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:12,850
Writing, task one. Form number 15. You want to get a public transport pass. Answer the questions in the form. Answer in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:13,533 --> 00:00:15,187
Where and how often do you travel?

3
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:29,753
Every day I take the bus to work and at weekends sometimes the metro to the centre.

4
00:00:30,667 --> 00:00:32,201
Why do you want a pass?

5
00:00:42,600 --> 00:00:47,179
I want a pass because it's cheaper and I don't have to buy a ticket every day.

6
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:49,734
How do you want to pay for the pass?

7
00:01:00,133 --> 00:01:04,242
I want to pay online by card, ideally for the whole year at once.

8
00:01:05,133 --> 00:01:14,239
Fill in form 15 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
